Package: apt-mirror-py
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${python3:Depends},
Description: mirror Debian-style package repositories
 apt-mirror-py downloads repository metadata and package archives into an
 apt-mirror-compatible host and path layout. It supports legacy mirror.list
 files, Deb822 sources, parallel downloads, cleanup, and systemd scheduling.
